sualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"537"},"sourceKey":"output","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"621"},"destinationKey":"input","guid":"75e0efeb-9d37-489a-98ac-e6eb9092c773","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"534"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"623"},"destinationKey":"input","guid":"627eb81c-b52d-4b1e-915a-56a4abfbdf80","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"537"},"sourceKey":"output","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"625"},"destinationKey":"input","guid":"8d8eee82-f2e8-4bdc-9921-ac26c6ddc729","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":300.0},"title":"1
      \u00b7 Entrar en Flee","body":"\n\nOn Enter State escribe CurrentState = Flee
      y cambia a FleeSpeed (5 por defecto). Mantiene autoBraking desactivado y stoppingDistance
      a 0. Los Literal de fallback permiten usar el grafo aunque no hayas creado
      las variables num\u00e9ricas opcionales.","colorTheme":"Blue","guid":"75866150-3613-47fe-94c9-abc50e92a433","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":380.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":680.0},"title":"2
      \u00b7 Configurar el movimiento","body":"\n\nAplica TurnSpeed y Acceleration
      al NavMeshAgent. Comprueba que est\u00e9 activo y sobre el NavMesh antes de
      poner isStopped = false. El agente conserva su navegaci\u00f3n y evita obst\u00e1culos
      mediante su configuraci\u00f3n de NavMesh.","colorTheme":"Blue","guid":"2b7d94da-91fa-483b-b700-c6e75bc5d6ca","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":760.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":1060.0},"title":"3
      \u00b7 Limitar los rec\u00e1lculos","body":"\n\nCooldown limita la b\u00fasqueda
      de destinos a una vez cada RepathInterval (0,35 segundos). Al entrar en Flee
      se reinicia y ejecuta una b\u00fasqueda inmediata. Update solo entra si el
      agente puede navegar. Threat viene de Object Variables; una referencia vac\u00eda
      no se usa para calcular posiciones.","colorTheme":"Orange","guid":"e16898d0-587a-48be-aa81-00623b4f8a3b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":1140.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":1440.0},"title":"4
      \u00b7 Calcular la direcci\u00f3n de escape","body":"\n\nposici\u00f3n del
      agente \u2212 posici\u00f3n de Threat apunta en sentido contrario a la amenaza.
      Scale elimina Y. Si el vector tiene longitud suficiente, normalized obtiene
      la direcci\u00f3n de huida. Si ambas posiciones coinciden, usa forward como
      alternativa para no normalizar un vector nulo.","colorTheme":"Red","guid":"ba1a6014-7679-4f4d-bff2-a5f010f855bb","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":1520.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":1820.0},"title":"5
      \u00b7 Proponer un destino de huida","body":"\n\nEscapeDirection apunta en
      sentido opuesto a Threat. El candidato se genera alrededor de la amenaza, con
      radio max(distancia actual + FleeDistance, distancia segura + 0,5 + SampleDistance).
      As\u00ed no se limita a un paso que pueda quedarse dentro de la zona de peligro.
      Si falla, prueba \u00e1ngulos alternativos.","colorTheme":"Red","guid":"02cd61e1-ea8a-4e2b-9409-1a5bb80cefbe","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":1900.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":2200.0},"title":"6
      \u00b7 Evitar destinos hacia la amenaza","body":"\n\nTras SamplePosition, resta
      al punto encontrado la posici\u00f3n del agente. Dot compara ese desplazamiento
      con EscapeDirection. Debe ser mayor que 0,1: el punto debe avanzar en la direcci\u00f3n
      de escape. Si no lo hace, conserva la ruta anterior y espera al pr\u00f3ximo
      intento.","colorTheme":"Orange","guid":"e7551c03-6ea3-4e3c-b30b-d06c39b38f76","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":2280.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":2580.0},"title":"7
      \u00b7 Comprobar que la ruta sea completa","body":"\n\nCrea un NavMeshPath
      y lo guarda como EscapePath en Flow Variables. CalculatePath debe devolver
      true y path.status debe ser PathComplete. Esto evita elegir como escape un
      punto al que el agente solo podr\u00eda aproximarse por una ruta parcial.","colorTheme":"Orange","guid":"d61cf01b-8701-471b-a6d7-4af77a4a4348","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":2660.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":2960.0},"title":"8
      \u00b7 Ejecutar la ruta de escape","body":"\n\nSetPath solo recibe rutas completas
      hacia un punto del NavMesh que cumpla la distancia segura. Si no hay un destino
      aceptable, conserva la ruta anterior y prueba otra direcci\u00f3n en el pr\u00f3ximo
      cooldown. SafeFleeDestination guarda en Graph Variables el \u00faltimo destino
      aceptado. No garantiza escapar si no existe ning\u00fan punto seguro accesible.","colorTheme":"Green","guid":"792fb289-b0f3-42dc-9c58-fca7888bfe42","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":3400.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":3730.0},"title":"9
      \u00b7 Distancia segura del destino","body":"\n\nDespu\u00e9s de SamplePosition
      se comprueba la posici\u00f3n real del punto sobre el NavMesh. Su distancia
      horizontal a Threat debe ser al menos max(SafeDistance, DetectDistance + 1).
      Usa el mismo l\u00edmite que la transici\u00f3n de regreso a Patrolling. Se
      compara distancia\u00b2 con l\u00edmite\u00b2. Un punto demasiado cerca se
      descarta.","colorTheme":"Red","guid":"9428462a-44db-4e0a-92eb-0d0b51dd48ed","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":3780.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":4110.0},"title":"10
      \u00b7 Buscar alternativas","body":"\n\nCada intento fallido incrementa EscapeAttempt.
      Se prueban 0\u00b0, -20\u00b0, 20\u00b0, -40\u00b0, 40\u00b0, -60\u00b0 y 60\u00b0
      alrededor de la direcci\u00f3n de huida. Si se acepta una ruta o se entra de
      nuevo en Flee, el contador vuelve a cero. Todos los candidatos deben superar
      la distancia m\u00ednima, avanzar hacia fuera y tener una ruta completa.","colorTheme":"Orange","guid":"6a075c08-8916-43cc-8464-ad6632f180a7","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"isStart":false,"position":{"x":150.0,"y":0.0},"width":230.0,"guid":"96e0d6fa-7713-4836-a48a-308ccd1e77ff","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.FlowState","$id":"342"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Amenaza
      cerca","summary":"Patrolling -> Flee cuando distancia XZ <= DetectDistance.","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":0.7,"elements":[{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"632853c6-1bb5-435f-b7c2-47dbd9411784","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Update","$id":"783"},{"member":{"name":"transform","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"bd9658fd-94e9-4cf8-b066-5d9b30689b67","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"785"},{"member":{"name":"position","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"UnityEngine.Transform","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.Transform","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":2240.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"b5effa37-33e4-4874-bafe-98f3ec5ee778","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"788"},{"member":{"name":"position","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"UnityEngine.Transform","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.Transform","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":null},"position":{"x":1920.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"6528454a-b37b-4c83-81c8-b508a096db73","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"791"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":960.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"3ca22c95-a3d6-4ce6-a2d1-7d3ab6e17c32","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.NullCheck","$id":"794"},{"specifyFallback":true,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Threat","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":320.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"caf40b29-67d4-4c61-933e-c93393f9a69b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"796"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["a","b"],"member":{"name":"op_Subtraction","parameterTypes":["UnityEngine.Vector3","UnityEngine.Vector3"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.Vector3","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.Vector3","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%a":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"},"%b":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"}},"position":{"x":2560.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"ce91d803-f3a8-40c9-a46c-7b295cb78992","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"798"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":1280.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"421415fa-9d2d-43a7-8e54-ca116bae313d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerStateTransition","$id":"802"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":640.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"b16601eb-4fe2-43d3-83f7-9af00c6baffe","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Null","$id":"804"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["a","b"],"member":{"name":"Scale","parameterTypes":["UnityEngine.Vector3","UnityEngine.Vector3"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.Vector3","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.Vector3","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%a":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"},"%b":{"x":1.0,"y":0.0,"z":1.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"}},"position":{"x":2880.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"78c3a485-59eb-4812-a327-8be2ecbd3409","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"806"},{"type":"System.Single","value":{"$content":6.0,"$type":"System.Single"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":960.0,"y":380.0},"guid":"0df90525-ad4b-47ea-a87c-42dbb19bd467","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"810"},{"specifyFallback":true,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"DetectDistance","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":640.0,"y":380.0},"guid":"90d77bc6-c8a5-45d6-b96b-f95533443386","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"812"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":1920.0,"y":380.0},"guid":"f645c6dc-e6ac-4af1-897a-9c2b0fa4851b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"814"},{"defaultValues":{"b":{"$content":1.0,"$type":"System.Single"}},"position":{"x":1280.0,"y":380.0},"guid":"9352426e-920b-41d2-9224-a4b50c3823af","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ScalarMultiply","$id":"816"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["a","b"],"member":{"name":"Max","parameterTypes":["System.Single","System.Single"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.Mathf","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.Mathf","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%a":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Single"},"%b":{"$content":0.1,"$type":"System.Single"}},"position":{"x":320.0,"y":380.0},"guid":"a8b1741b-6a80-4bbd-9d09-8971079af78a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"818"},{"member":{"name":"sqrMagnitude","parameterTypes":null,"targetType":"UnityEngine.Vector3","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.Vector3","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"target":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Vector3"}},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":380.0},"guid":"6c9b61e7-5f18-4563-b62a-0e06103febe3","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetMember","$id":"822"},{"numeric":true,"defaultValues":{"b":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Single"}},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":380.0},"guid":"04eb3ba1-17df-4b3d-b98e-e884de30eab0","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.LessOrEqual","$id":"825"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"814"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"802"},"destinationKey":"trigger","guid":"04ba447b-e4fd-4b7a-9bf3-1e225e39db7d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"783"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"794"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"91845533-2177-43b8-bdd0-bf4a268d99a4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"794"},"sourceKey":"ifNotNull","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"814"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"48ff4ae6-81f4-4d77-8be2-8bfbc647175f","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"818"},"sourceKey":"result","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"816"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"ae5a6465-9a69-4bcd-b449-cd16197d4370","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"810"},"sourceKey":"output","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"812"},"destinationKey":"fallback","guid":"7bf01300-3bbc-42ab-a717-da757a21ff56","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"812"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"818"},"destinationKey":"%a","guid":"951e1dfc-19f4-40eb-b7d7-f0cca800e7f6","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"818"},"sourceKey":"result","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"816"},"destinationKey":"b","guid":"d399ab5b-32ac-47a4-912f-cb60e7c8cb38","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"806"},"sourceKey":"result","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"822"},"destinationKey":"target","guid":"55065208-c605-407b-82dc-ae1463b11045","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"816"},"sourceKey":"product","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"825"},"destinationKey":"b","guid":"579f06f0-f618-45da-b70e-57eff70fd463","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"796"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"794"},"destinationKey":"input","guid":"845b3a9c-a02b-4f0f-a57c-028c577d794a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"822"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"825"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"b0a14e5d-1a4f-4b24-8b35-2322cc75e316","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"804"},"sourceKey":"null","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"796"},"destinationKey":"fallback","guid":"e2446b28-42dd-4674-8032-ce9ce8d2f1fd","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"791"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"798"},"destinationKey":"%b","guid":"343549b6-4467-43fe-a129-978041dfac2d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"796"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"785"},"destinationKey":"target","guid":"56b2c828-fc29-445d-b506-98744205bdc4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"785"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"791"},"destinationKey":"target","guid":"a566ca88-f657-4c5f-8800-d37e4ae06573","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"788"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"798"},"destinationKey":"%a","guid":"83ac4d72-01b6-4f4a-a3d0-fa5d4d97d200","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"798"},"sourceKey":"result","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"806"},"destinationKey":"%a","guid":"4217f847-d303-4acf-97c4-0d752b5c7d72","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"825"},"sourceKey":"comparison","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"814"},"destinationKey":"condition","guid":"fa408f66-1a79-44c4-a7cb-0a3aec76f2cd","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":300.0},"title":"1
      \u00b7 Comprobar si hay amenaza","body":"\n\nEsta transici\u00f3n solo se escucha
      mientras Patrolling est\u00e1 activo. Update lee Threat y NullCheck comprueba
      que exista. Sin amenaza, no cambia de estado. Lee las posiciones del agente
      y de Threat y elimina la diferencia en Y para detectar por distancia horizontal.","colorTheme":"Orange","guid":"7a9eb8f3-13ee-4048-81a7-5e0feb25c7c7","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-550.0,"yMin":380.0,"xMax":-80.0,"yMax":680.0},"title":"2
      \u00b7 Pasar de Patrolling a Flee","body":"\n\nsqrMagnitude es la distancia
      al cuadrado. DetectDistance tiene valor por defecto 6 y un m\u00ednimo de 0,1.
      Multiplica ese l\u00edmite por s\u00ed mismo y compara distancia\u00b2 \u2264
      l\u00edmite\u00b2, evitando una ra\u00edz cuadrada. Si se cumple, Trigger State
      Transition sale de Patrolling y entra en Flee.","colorTheme":"Red","guid":"ced9105d-6bf1-48b5-ba20-8ca996593ea8","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"source":{"$ref":"3"},"destination":{"$ref":"342"},"guid":"caab462d-e713-412f-b03c-5b7b63ea8cd7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.FlowStateTransition"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Distancia
      segura","summary":"Flee -> Patrolling cuando distancia XZ >= max(SafeDistance,
